WEBVTT

00:50:26.950 --> 00:50:31.648
KFL: Yeah, I think graphic artist
is a good example.

00:50:31.672 --> 00:50:33.939
AI is beginning to do some of that.

00:50:34.849 --> 00:50:37.029
Photographer is another example.

00:50:37.053 --> 00:50:42.883
But I think that category
will be the most creative jobs.

00:50:42.907 --> 00:50:46.573
Those jobs are going to be safe
for a long time to come,

00:50:46.597 --> 00:50:52.964
and also, there is an opportunity
for human-AI symbiosis.

00:50:52.988 --> 00:50:58.456
That is, a creative scientist,
trying to invent a new drug,

00:50:58.480 --> 00:51:04.119
now assisted by AI to do
the filtering and the ideation,